{
  "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/shorten-the-cut-for-a-dissolve-walk",
  "seed": "The recording used to its last frame and a second clip dropped after it at full length leave a cut with no spare frames either side. A cross dissolve put on it from the cut's right-click goes on anyway, holding the edge frames (Paid with 0.4s of held frames), and Properties offers Or, Shorten the cut by 0.4s to play real footage instead. Choosing it trims 0.2s off each clip end, closes the gap and keeps the cross dissolve, now paid with real footage, as one step to undo. At Next defaults, no flag set.",
